Subject: [PATCH] fix(chronik): index explicit genesis and bound V2 staging and
 undo decoding

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Index genesis explicitly and bound V2 branch staging and undo decoding before accepting persistent state transitions. Expanded isolated database checks cover these limits and rollback cases; the reported 44 passing checks apply to the isolated Chronik database target rather than a running node.

